<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><meta name="description" content="<%= description %>"><link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css"><script type="application/ld+json"><%- JSON.stringify(jsonLd).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script>
<style>
:root{--ink:#102317;--green:#173d28;--deep:#0b2415;--gold:#e0ae4b;--paper:#f7f4ec;--line:#dfddd3;--muted:#647067}*{box-sizing:border-box}.page{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px}.hero{min-height:650px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#07170c 0%,#123822 55%,#254f36 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 25%,#ffffff18,transparent 28%),linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 55%,#07170ce8);pointer-events:none}.nav{position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:24px 0}.logo{font:28px Georgia,serif;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.nav a:not(.logo){color:#dbe7de;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:100px 0 110px;max-width:900px}.eyebrow{color:#f1c66a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.hero h1{font:400 clamp(48px,8vw,92px)/.91 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0 20px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.hero p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;color:#dce7df;max-width:760px}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.btn{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 18px;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.primary{background:var(--gold);color:#162515}.ghost{border:1px solid #ffffff42;color:#fff;background:#ffffff0c}.quick{margin-top:-55px;position:relative;z-index:4}.quick-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#c9c6bb;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 50px #10231722}.quick a{background:#fff;padding:22px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.quick strong{display:block;font:400 24px Georgia,serif}.quick span{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.main{padding:70px 0 100px}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:22px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px #1023170a}.card h2{font:400 34px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px}.card h3{font:400 23px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 8px}.card p,.card li{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}.stats{display:grid;gap:10px}.stat{padding:18px;border-radius:16px;background:#eef0e8}.stat b{font:400 31px Georgia,serif;display:block}.stat span{font-size:11px;color:#667166}.section{margin-top:22px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:15px;margin-bottom:12px}.section-head h2{margin:0;font:400 36px Georgia,serif}.section-head a{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:var(--green);text-decoration:none}.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);min-height:170px}.tile .num{font-size:10px;color:#9a6f20;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em}.tile h3{font:400 25px Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0 7px}.tile p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.plan{background:var(--deep);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:24px}.plan h3{font:400 26px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 8px}.plan p{color:#cbd9cf;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.plan a{color:#f1c66a;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none}.affiliate{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.affiliate a{background:#f1eee5;color:var(--ink);padding:15px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.owner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:18px;align-items:center;background:#e8ecdf}.owner a{justify-self:end}.disclosure{margin-top:22px;padding:14px 16px;background:#eeece4;border-radius:12px;color:#687169;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:800px){.quick-grid,.tiles,.plans,.intro,.owner{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.owner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.owner a{justify-self:start}}@media(max-width:560px){.navlinks{display:none}.hero{min-height:600px}.hero-content{padding-top:65px}.quick-grid,.tiles,.plans,.intro,.affiliate{grid-template-columns:1fr}.quick{margin-top:-25px}.card{padding:21px}}
</style></head><body><div class="page"><header class="hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="nav"><a class="logo" href="/">OzarkRoost</a><div class="navlinks"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/listings">Stays</a><a href="/adventures">Adventures</a><a href="/list-your-cabin">List Free</a></div></nav><div class="hero-content"><div class="eyebrow">Flagship destination · Arkansas Ozarks</div><h1>Buffalo River</h1><p>Come for the bluffs. Stay for the river. Build the trip around floating, hiking, camping, cabins, wildlife and dark skies along one of the Ozarks' defining landscapes.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.nps.gov/buff/planyourvisit/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check official park info →</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/listings">Find places to stay</a></div></div></div></header><div class="wrap quick"><div class="quick-grid"><a href="#float"><strong>Float</strong><span>River access, conditions and trip planning</span></a><a href="#hike"><strong>Hike</strong><span>100+ miles of maintained trails</span></a><a href="#stay"><strong>Stay</strong><span>Cabins, camping and nearby lodging</span></a><a href="#plan"><strong>Plan</strong><span>Half-day, full-day and weekend ideas</span></a></div></div><main class="wrap main"><section class="intro"><article class="card"><h2>Why the Buffalo belongs on your list</h2><p>Buffalo National River was established in 1972 and protects 135 miles of free-flowing river through the Ozark Mountains. The park combines running water, quiet pools, towering bluffs, caves, springs, trails, historic places and broad backcountry.</p><p>OzarkRoost turns that big landscape into a trip you can actually plan: choose your adventure, find a place to sleep, compare experiences and keep moving.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/adventures/buffalo-national-river">Open adventure profile →</a><a class="btn ghost" style="background:#f1eee5;color:#173d28;border:0" href="/guides/buffalo-river-cabins">Buffalo River cabins</a></div></article><aside class="card stats"><div class="stat"><b>135 mi</b><span>river protected by the national river</span></div><div class="stat"><b>100+ mi</b><span>maintained trails to explore</span></div><div class="stat"><b>3</b><span>major park districts to use as planning anchors</span></div></aside></section><section class="section" id="float"><div class="section-head"><h2>Choose your Buffalo adventure</h2><a href="/adventures">See the directory →</a></div><div class="tiles"><a class="tile" href="/guides/buffalo-river-float-trips"><span class="num">01 · WATER</span><h3>Float the river</h3><p>Use the official flow and access information, then match a float to your time, skill and desired scenery.</p></a><a class="tile" id="hike" href="/guides/best-hiking-ozarks"><span class="num">02 · TRAILS</span><h3>Hike the bluffs</h3><p>Explore river trails, overlooks and Ozark terrain. Confirm trail rules and conditions before setting out.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-camping"><span class="num">03 · CAMP</span><h3>Sleep outside</h3><p>Choose developed campgrounds or appropriate backcountry options and plan around river conditions.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/best-cabins-buffalo-river"><span class="num">04 · CABINS</span><h3>Get a cabin</h3><p>Turn a river day into a weekend with a nearby cabin or lodging base.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-fishing-trips"><span class="num">05 · FISH</span><h3>Cast a line</h3><p>Fishing is available along the river and tributary streams. Check current regulations first.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/about-the-ozarks"><span class="num">06 · BEYOND</span><h3>Keep exploring</h3><p>Connect Buffalo River days with Jasper, Eureka Springs, Ozark Highlands and the wider region.</p></a></div></section><section class="section" id="stay"><div class="section-head"><h2>Stay near the river</h2><a href="/listings">Browse stays →</a></div><div class="card"><p>Use OzarkRoost as your planning layer: discover lodging first, then build the activities around it. Paid and founding listings can earn prominent placement while travelers get a cleaner shortlist.</p><div class="affiliate"><% affiliateLinks.forEach(link=>{ %><a href="/out?to=<%= encodeURIComponent(link.url) %>&partner=<%= encodeURIComponent(link.key) %>" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><%= link.label %> ↗</a><% }) %></div><p style="font-size:11px">Affiliate disclosure: configured partner links may earn OzarkRoost a commission at no additional cost to the traveler.</p></div></section><section class="section" id="plan"><div class="section-head"><h2>Build the trip</h2></div><div class="plans"><article class="plan"><h3>Half day</h3><p>Pick one access point, one short trail and time to sit by the river. Best when you're passing through or want a focused first look.</p><a href="/guides/buffalo-river-float-trips">Start with float planning →</a></article><article class="plan"><h3>Full day</h3><p>Pair a morning adventure with an afternoon float, hike or historic stop. Check current conditions and daylight before committing.</p><a href="/guides/things-to-do-near-buffalo-river">See things to do →</a></article><article class="plan"><h3>Weekend</h3><p>Book a base, choose two signature activities and leave room for weather. Add a second Ozarks destination if the route makes sense.</p><a href="/guides/ozarks-weekend-getaway">Build a weekend →</a></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="card owner"><div><h2>Own a Buffalo-area business?</h2><p>Get a founding directory presence while the destination hub is growing. Cabins, outfitters, restaurants, guides and local experiences can claim their spot and add official details.</p></div><a class="btn primary" href="/list-your-cabin">Claim a free founding spot →</a></div></section><div class="disclosure">OzarkRoost is an independent travel directory. Buffalo National River facts and rules can change; verify current river conditions, access, reservations, fees and regulations with the National Park Service before traveling.</div></main></div></body></html>